      "title": "Fund terms",
      "titleLines": 1,
      "text": "07 \u00b7 INVESTOR TERMS\nFund terms\n\nProposed terms for a $150 million, three-year closed-ended GPU credit fund.\n\nFund\n\t\nAI Infra Access Fund \u00b7 Cayman Islands\n\t\nUnderlying assets\n\t\nSenior secured GPU equipment loans across multiple offtakers\n\n\nType\n\t\nClosed-ended private credit fund\n\t\nTarget net IRR\n\t\n14%\n\n\nTarget size\n\t\n$150 million\n\t\nManagement fee\n\t\n1%\n\n\nFund term\n\t\n3 years\n\t\nPerformance fee\n\t\n10%\n\n\nMinimum subscription\n\t\n$5 million\n\t\nHurdle rate\n\t\n6%\n\n\nCapital calls\n\t\nWithin 14 days of notice\n\n\nGP commitment\n\t\nMore than 10%; same class as LPs\n\n\nInvestor liquidity\n\t\nHold through wind-down; transfers subject to agreed consent rules\n\n\nDistributions\n\t\nAfter the first year: available principal and income, net of liabilities, expenses and reserves.\nOpenSilicon\nConfidential \u00b7 October 2026\n11 / 14",
