    "appendix": {
      "title": "Illustrative Portfolio Assumptions",
      "titleLines": 1,
      "text": "APPENDIX A \u00b7 PORTFOLIO MODEL\nIllustrative Portfolio Assumptions\n\nRepresentative project inputs for the proposed portfolio model.\n\nEquipment cost\n\t\n~$280m\n\t\nProject debt\n\t\n~$170m (~60% of equipment cost)\n\n\nGross revenue\n\t\n~$150m per year\n\t\nBilling basis\n\t\n~$6 / GPU-hour; ~2,900 billable GPUs at full billing\n\n\nCustomer prepayment\n\t\n~$130m at inception (~30% of modeled three-year revenue)\n\t\nBilling credits\n\t\nPrepayment counted once; later invoice credits\n\n\nCash after credits\n\t\n~$100m per year\n\t\nData-center cost\n\t\n~$20m per year\n\n\nCash after DC cost\n\t\n~$80m per year, or ~$7m per month\n\t\nModeled DSCR\n\t\n~1.2x\n\n\nProposed financing\n\t\n15% p.a.; ~3-year tenor\n\t\nDebt service\n\t\nMonthly amortization; ~$6m per month\n\n\nBOM subtotal\n\t\n~$280m\n\t\nDeployment\n\t\n40 active + 2 spare racks\n\n\nFunding and scope\n\t\nDebt and company capital fund deployments. Amounts are rounded. DSCR compares cash after credits and DC cost with debt service, before other costs, tax and reserves.\nOpenSilicon\nConfidential \u00b7 October 2026\n14 / 14",
